ally works out  all right I put a little ice cream shop  in there but it's only kind of imaginary  because I didn't want to ruin the nice  look of the actual door with a star so  it's a little bit of a fake ice cream  shop here and uses some of the elements  which I believe if I remember correctly  are kind of typical for the area so for  instance some of the painted decorations  are coming back here  the building has some very classical  looking decorations on the walls but  rather than being actual stone  sculptures it's all just kind of painted  on the walls so for that I use the  Christmas decorations again to give some  sort of painted vibes to the decorations  and there's a lot less wood there's no  really wooden frameworks going on as  with the other buildings there's more of  a classical look to it so a very  traditional sort of shop fronts some  pillars on the sides a lot of stone  details and instead of a very large  gable on the front of the building the  only thing that I really added to this  to give it a sense of direction to give  it a sense of you know this part of the  building is the front is a small little  part over here he's taking out of the  roof as sort of a large dormer and a  decoration which kind of serves as the  same purpose of giving you the idea of  no this is the front of the building and  I'm not just looking at the back and of  course me being me I wanted to add a  very pointy bits to the top as well  because you know building doesn't really  work out that well without a unsewn peak  style kind of spire on top of it which  is actually interesting because I  couldn't show this in this video because  this is a very old video and is  recorded long before the newest update  came out but the newest update contains  a really interesting iron piece which  can be really great for these kind of  small spires so I'll be using that from  now on instead of the weird cables just  something fun I thought is added in this  new updates as one of those small pieces  which you can use in many ways which is  not really intended for in any case  that's it for this episode so thank you  guys for watching and I hope to see you  again next time  [Music]
 

